But you feel what?

627
00:45:14.978 --> 00:45:16.321
Nothing.

628
00:45:16.346 --> 00:45:18.451
But we can see the ring.

629
00:45:24.288 --> 00:45:25.426
Let's go!

630
00:45:25.789 --> 00:45:27.735
