644
00:46:07.798 --> 00:46:11.371
I'll look forever until you come back to be human!

645
00:46:12.503 --> 00:46:15.916
That was exciting.

646
00:46:16.473 --> 00:46:17.549
I knew it!

647
00:46:17.574 --> 00:46:18.817
You set us!

648
00:46:18.842 --> 00:46:20.583
