686
00:50:46.309 --> 00:50:47.879
Hello my friends.

687
00:50:47.978 --> 00:50:49.522
Look at your clothes.

688
00:50:49.546 --> 00:50:51.489
And you really a prince!

689
00:50:51.515 --> 00:50:53.722
You are very beautiful!

690
00:50:53.784 --> 00:50:56.822
