This means...?

748
00:54:50.620 --> 00:54:51.621
Sim?

749
00:54:51.755 --> 00:54:52.961
Not...

750
00:54:55.558 --> 00:54:56.536
Sim.

751
00:54:56.693 --> 00:54:58.263
I'll go with you.

752
00:54:58.928 --> 00:55:00.271
