833
00:59:35.972 --> 00:59:37.382
Do you think we can?

834
00:59:37.407 --> 00:59:38.818
Not really.

835
00:59:47.317 --> 00:59:48.295
You...

836
00:59:49.319 --> 00:59:51.321
Your disgusting rat!

837
