Again?

838
01:00:00.697 --> 01:00:02.608
Cinderella, where is it?

839
01:00:04.367 --> 01:00:05.345
Cinderella?

840
01:00:05.702 --> 01:00:06.703
Cinderella!

841
01:00:07.503 --> 01:00:09.915
Worry about you first.

842
01:00:12.775 --> 01:00:14.777
