843
01:00:32.929 --> 01:00:35.603
- Why are we running? - Let's find Cinderella.

844
01:00:36.532 --> 01:00:37.909
A dog!

845
01:00:38.901 --> 01:00:40.847
Let's run away!

846
01:00:49.479 --> 01:00:51.891
